    "headline": "VIVIFY Chief Systems Architect Buddy Paul Relocates to Delray Beach as Company Moves from Fabrication to Manufacturing; Founder Jason Herring Marks the Milestone with Rolex Milgauss Presentation",
    "summary": "VIVIFY Technology, a hydrogen energy company headquartered in South Florida, today announced that Distinguished Engineer & Chief Systems Architect Buddy Paul is relocating to Delray Beach, Florida, to lead the company's new manufacturing facility located in Jupiter, marking VIVIFY's transition from fabrication to manufacturing at scale. Founder and CEO Jason Herring marked the occasion by presenting Paul with a Rolex Milgauss, recognizing the engineering work that carried VIVIFY to this point.",
